@startuml
title UML 类图：活动票务核心领域模型
top to bottom direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F4F8FF
skinparam classBorderColor #3766A6
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty members

abstract class "用户 User" as User {
  +id: UUID [可空]
  +username: String [可空]
  +phone: String [可空]
  +passwordHash: String [可空]
}
class "匿名用户" as Guest {
  +查询已发布活动()
}
class "实名用户（参与者）" as Participant {
  +报名或候补()
  +取消与退票()
}
class "活动发布者" as Organizer {
  +创建并提交活动()
  +取消本人活动()
}
class "检票员" as Checker {
  +核验票并签到()
}
class "平台管理员" as Admin {
  +审核活动()
  +处理举报与权限()
}
User <|-- Guest
User <|-- Participant
User <|-- Organizer
User <|-- Checker
User <|-- Admin

class "活动类别" as Category {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +enabled: Boolean
}
class "活动" as Event {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +categoryId: UUID
  +startAt: DateTime
  +endAt: DateTime
  +saleStart: DateTime
  +saleEnd: DateTime
  +price: Decimal
  +capacity: Integer
  +/occupied: Integer
  +status: String
}
class "报名" as Registration {
  +id: UUID
  +status: String
  +queueSeq: Long
  +requestId: String
}
class "订单" as Order {
  +id: UUID
  +amount: Decimal
  +status: String
  +payDeadline: DateTime
}
class "电子票" as Ticket {
  +id: UUID
  +code: String
  +status: String
  +checkedAt: DateTime
}
Organizer "1" -- "0..*" Event : 创建与管理
Category "1" -- "0..*" Event : 归类
Event "1" -- "0..*" Registration : 接受报名
Participant "1" -- "0..*" Registration : 发起
Registration "1" -- "0..1" Order : 获得名额后产生
Order "1" -- "0..1" Ticket : 模拟支付后出票

note left of User
  匿名用户无账号，不持久化；其余四类账号须有手机号。
  这里“实名用户”指普通参与者，不增加身份核验。
  类型由子类表达，领域模型不另设 role 字段。
end note
note bottom of Event
  一个活动仅一个场次、一个票种，时间、价格和容量直接归活动。
  occupied = 有效待支付订单数 + 已支付未退款订单数；
  0 <= occupied <= capacity。
end note
note right of Ticket
  检票员核验电子票；平台管理员审核活动。
  举报与操作记录单独放在治理类图中。
end note
note bottom of Registration
  候补不占库存；同一参与者对同一活动
  同时最多一条未结束报名。
end note
@enduml

